    app.games.** -> app.chess.**
    app.games.** -> app.study.interfaces.game_priority
unmatched_ignore_imports_alerting = none
broken_contract_guidance = Keep own implementation, explicit contracts and neutral chess support; outer composition wires other capabilities.

